{
    "chapter_num": 3,
    "verses_count": 32,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Rebuilding the Wall"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Eliashib the high priest rose up with his brethren the priests and built the Sheep Gate; they consecrated it and hung its doors. They built as far as the Tower of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Heb. Hammeah"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the Hundred, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " consecrated it, then as far as the Tower of Hananel. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. On his hand"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Next to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Eliashib"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the men of Jericho built. And next to them Zaccur the son of Imri built."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also the sons of Hassenaah built the Fish Gate; they laid its beams and hung its doors with its bolts and bars. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And next to them Meremoth the son of Urijah, the son of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or Hakkoz"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Koz, made repairs. Next to them Meshullam the son of Berechiah, the son of Meshezabel, made repairs. Next to them Zadok the son of Baana made repairs. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Next to them the Tekoites made repairs; but their nobles did not put their "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. necks"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "shoulders to the work of their Lord."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Moreover Jehoiada the son of Paseah and Meshullam the son of Besodeiah repaired the Old Gate; they laid its beams and hung its doors, with its bolts and bars. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And next to them Melatiah the Gibeonite, Jadon the Meronothite, the men of Gibeon and Mizpah, repaired the residence"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. throne"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the governor "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "of the region"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "West of the Euphrates"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "beyond the River. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Next to him Uzziel the son of Harhaiah, one of the goldsmiths, made repairs. Also next to him Hananiah, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. the son"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "one of the perfumers, made repairs; and they "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "restored"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "fortified Jerusalem as far as the Broad Wall. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And next to them Rephaiah the son of Hur, leader of half the district of Jerusalem, made repairs. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Next to them Jedaiah the son of Harumaph made repairs in front of his house. And next to him Hattush the son of Hashabniah made repairs."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Malchijah the son of Harim and Hashub the son of Pahath-Moab repaired another section, as well as the Tower of the Ovens. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And next to him was Shallum the son of Hallohesh, leader of half the district of Jerusalem; he and his daughters made repairs."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Hanun and the inhabitants of Zanoah repaired the Valley Gate. They built it, hung its doors with its bolts and bars, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "repaired"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a thousand cubits of the wall as far as the Refuse Gate."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Malchijah the son of Rechab, leader of the district of Beth Haccerem, repaired the Refuse Gate; he built it and hung its doors with its bolts and bars."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Shallun the son of Col-Hozeh, leader of the district of Mizpah, repaired the Fountain Gate; he built it, covered it, hung its doors with its bolts and bars, and repaired the wall of the Pool of Shelah"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or Shiloah"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " by the King’s Garden, as far as the stairs that go down from the City of David. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After him Nehemiah the son of Azbuk, leader of half the district of Beth Zur, made repairs as far as "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the place"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in front of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "LXX, Syr., Vg. tomb"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "tombs of David, to the man-made pool, and as far as the House of the Mighty."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After him the Levites, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "under"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Rehum the son of Bani, made repairs. Next to him Hashabiah, leader of half the district of Keilah, made repairs for his district. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After him their brethren, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "under"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "So with MT, Vg.; some Heb. mss., LXX, Syr. Binnui (cf. v. 24)"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Bavai the son of Henadad, leader of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "other"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " half of the district of Keilah, made repairs. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And next to him Ezer the son of Jeshua, the leader of Mizpah, repaired another section in front of the Ascent to the Armory at the buttress."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. turning"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After him Baruch the son of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "A few Heb. mss., Syr., Vg. Zaccai"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Zabbai carefully repaired the other section, from the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. turning"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "buttress to the door of the house of Eliashib the high priest. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After him Meremoth the son of Urijah, the son of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or Hakkoz"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Koz, repaired another section, from the door of the house of Eliashib to the end of the house of Eliashib."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And after him the priests, the men of the plain, made repairs. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After him Benjamin and Hasshub made repairs opposite their house. After them Azariah the son of Maaseiah, the son of Ananiah, made repairs by his house. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After him Binnui the son of Henadad repaired another section, from the house of Azariah to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. turning"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "buttress, even as far as the corner. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Palal the son of Uzai "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "made repairs"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " opposite the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. turning"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "buttress, and on the tower which projects from the king’s upper house that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " by the court of the prison. After him Pedaiah the son of Parosh "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "made repairs."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Moreover the Nethinim who dwelt in Ophel "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "made repairs"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " as far as "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the place"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in front of the Water Gate toward the east, and on the projecting tower. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After them the Tekoites repaired another section, next to the great projecting tower, and as far as the wall of Ophel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Beyond the Horse Gate the priests made repairs, each in front of his "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "own"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " house. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After them Zadok the son of Immer made repairs in front of his "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "own"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " house. After him Shemaiah the son of Shechaniah, the keeper of the East Gate, made repairs. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After him Hananiah the son of Shelemiah, and Hanun, the sixth son of Zalaph, repaired another section. After him Meshullam the son of Berechiah made repairs in front of his "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. room"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "dwelling. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After him Malchijah, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. a son of the goldsmiths"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "one of the goldsmiths, made repairs as far as the house of the Nethinim and of the merchants, in front of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Inspection or Recruiting"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Miphkad Gate, and as far as the upper room at the corner. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And between the upper room at the corner, as far as the Sheep Gate, the goldsmiths and the merchants made repairs."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}